{"version":1,"content":"<p>知名硬件檢測工具CPU-Z近日公佈的最新統計數據顯示，16GB系統內存配置在用户羣體中的佔比正重新擴大，而近年來持續增長的32GB和64GB配置則出現不同程度回落。這一變化反映出個人電腦市場在硬件升級策略方面正在發生新的調整。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585428.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.670075+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":118,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-08T07:22:22+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T10:15:42.699999+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.770622+00:00","content_hash":"94f632abbc569b79d9ee83228b39cecde2e513095123223fb5973e9d4ea9fa41","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}